{"id":"0c89f083102fc433","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md","title":"Strongly Compact Cardinal","display":"df-strongly-compact — Strongly Compact Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-strongly-compact","aliases":["58-df-strongly-compact","58-df-zfc-cardinal8-strongly-compact-cardinal"],"display":"df-strongly-compact — Strongly Compact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-strongly-compact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-strongly-compact</span><span>58-df-zfc-cardinal8-strongly-compact-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strongly-compact — Strongly Compact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter\">58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-strongly-compact-—-Strongly-Compact\">df-strongly-compact — Strongly Compact</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\\)</span> (complete-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter\">58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyCompact}\\)</span> (strong-compactness predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StronglyCompactCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StronglyCompactCardinal}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\land F\\subseteq U)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteUltrafilter}_S(U,X,\\kappa)\\land F\\subseteq U)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StronglyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8StronglyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete filter-extension characterization of strong compactness.</li>\n<li>The requirement is over filters on arbitrary sets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, not only filters on cardinals <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headin